block content

    .source_info
        markdown
            small note: this widget has a performance issues, so we are using the <a href="/specs/products/pericles/widgets/list-of-issues-links/"> List of issues links</a> widget instead.
            small you may found that this widget has some ui issues please refer to <a href="/specs/products/pericles/widgets/list-of-issues-links/"> List of issues links</a>
